{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5251a411-b254-4ac6-a58a-5088160fcee1",
    "name": "central-ai-mcp",
    "description": "LPU Nexus — Central AI Module API Collection.\n\nRecommended workflow:\n1. Run **Auth / Admin Login** with your admin email + password. This is the ONLY admin auth path and populates `{{admin_access_token}}`, used by every request in Apps (Admin), RAG (Admin), and Observability (Admin).\n2. Run **Apps (Admin) / Bootstrap New App (PKI)** to create an app and capture `app_id`, `private_key`, and `public_key`.\n3. For production-style chatbot auth, run **Auth / Get App Token (PKI)** or **Auth / Get App User Token** with a backend-minted `signed_token`.\n4. For local development only, **Auth / Get App User Token (Dev Convenience)** signs the app JWT for you from a private key.\n\nSeed the first super_admin with `python -m db.seed_admin`.\n\nVariables:\n- `base_url` (default: `http://localhost:5123`)\n- `admin_email` / `admin_password` — your admin dashboard credentials\n- `admin_access_token` / `admin_refresh_token` — populated by Admin Login\n- `access_token` / `refresh_token` — chatbot app-user tokens, populated by test script\n- `app_id` — populated by bootstrap/register requests\n- `app_private_key` / `app_public_key` — populated by bootstrap request\n- `job_id` — populated by RAG crawl request",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "53539765",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/53539765-5251a411-b254-4ac6-a58a-5088160fcee1?source=collection_link"
  },
