            "description": "One-shot PKI bootstrap. The proxy generates an ES256 keypair, registers the app, and returns `app_id`, `private_key`, and `public_key`. Postman stores the returned values in environment variables.\n\nRequires a super_admin bearer token — run **Auth / Admin Login** first."
          },
          "response": []
