            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"What are the admission requirements for B.Tech CSE?\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/chat/message",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chat",
                "message"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Main chat endpoint. Runs the full LangGraph pipeline:\n\n1. Intent classification (fast model) — skipped if token has `force_workflow`\n2. Semantic cache lookup\n3. Data fetch (student record, RAG context)\n4. Context building\n5. LLM reasoning (smart model)\n6. Cache store\n\nWorkflow routing is controlled at the token level via `force_workflow` (set during token issuance), NOT per-message.\n\nResponse includes `response` text, `workflow` name, `cache_hit` flag, and optional `lead_progress` for lead-capture workflows."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
