            "description": "Directly call an allowlisted MCP tool through the proxy.\n\nThe tool must be in the `allowed_tools` list for the calling app (embedded in the JWT). The proxy enforces ownership — non-admin users can only query their own `student_id`.\n\nReplace `get_student` in the URL with any other allowlisted tool name."
