    {
      "name": "RAG (Admin)",
      "description": "Admin endpoints for RAG knowledge base management. All endpoints require an admin dashboard JWT token. App-signed tokens are no longer accepted for /api/rag/ingest operations.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Trigger Website Crawl",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Store crawl job_id\", function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.job_id) pm.environment.set(\"job_id\", json.job_id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"app_id\": \"{{app_id}}\",\n  \"seed_url\": \"https://www.lpu.in/\",\n  \"max_depth\": 2,\n  \"allowed_paths\": [\"/admissions\", \"/programmes\", \"/fees\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/rag/crawl",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "rag",
                "crawl"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Trigger an async BFS website crawl to populate the RAG knowledge base for a given `app_id`.\n\n**Requires admin JWT** (`{{admin_access_token}}`).\n\nThe crawler:\n- Stays within the same domain as `seed_url`\n- Skips binary assets (.pdf, .jpg, .css, .js, etc.)\n- Uses Trafilatura for content extraction (falls back to BeautifulSoup)\n- Rate-limits itself (500ms delay, max 5 concurrent)\n\n`allowed_paths` optionally restricts crawling to specific URL path prefixes.\n\nReturns a `job_id` — poll `/api/rag/status/{job_id}` to track progress."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest URL",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"app_id\": \"{{app_id}}\",\n  \"source_type\": \"url\",\n  \"source_ref\": \"https://www.lpu.in/admissions/btech.php\",\n  \"content\": \"https://www.lpu.in/admissions/btech.php\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/rag/ingest",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "rag",
                "ingest"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ingest a single URL into the RAG knowledge base for a given `app_id`.\n\n**Requires admin JWT** (`{{admin_access_token}}`). Admin dashboard tokens required; app-signed tokens no longer accepted.\n\nThe pipeline: fetch → extract text → SHA-256 dedup check → chunk (512 tok / 64 overlap) → embed → upsert to ChromaDB."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest File (PDF/DOCX)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"app_id\": \"{{app_id}}\",\n  \"source_type\": \"file\",\n  \"source_ref\": \"prospectus-2025.pdf\",\n  \"content\": \"<base64-encoded-file-bytes>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/rag/ingest",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "rag",
                "ingest"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ingest a file (PDF, DOCX, or plain text) into the RAG knowledge base.\n\n**Requires admin JWT** (`{{admin_access_token}}`). Admin dashboard tokens required; app-signed tokens no longer accepted.\n\n`content` must be base64-encoded bytes of the file. Supported formats:\n- `.pdf` — text extracted via PyPDF\n- `.docx` — text extracted via python-docx\n- Any other extension — decoded as UTF-8 plain text"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest Structured Data",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"app_id\": \"{{app_id}}\",\n  \"source_type\": \"structured\",\n  \"source_ref\": \"fee-structure-2025\",\n  \"content\": \"[{\\\"programme\\\": \\\"B.Tech CSE\\\", \\\"annual_fee\\\": \\\"180000\\\", \\\"duration\\\": \\\"4 years\\\"}, {\\\"programme\\\": \\\"MBA\\\", \\\"annual_fee\\\": \\\"150000\\\", \\\"duration\\\": \\\"2 years\\\"}]\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/rag/ingest",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "rag",
                "ingest"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ingest structured knowledge with native JSON records.\n\n**Requires admin JWT** (`{{admin_access_token}}`). Admin dashboard tokens required; app-signed tokens no longer accepted.\n\nPreferred fields:\n- `records`: array of objects to flatten into ingest text\n- `source_url`: canonical source link for citations\n\nBackward compatible:\n- `content`: JSON string containing an object or array\n\nArray records are flattened into `key: value | key: value` rows before chunking."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Crawl Job Status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/rag/status/{{job_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "rag",
                "status",
                "{{job_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Poll the status of a crawl job created by `POST /api/rag/crawl`.\n\n**Requires admin JWT** (`{{admin_access_token}}`).\n\nSet `{{job_id}}` in your environment to the `job_id` returned by the crawl endpoint.\n\nStatus lifecycle: `queued` → `processing` → `done` | `failed`\n\nResponse includes `pages_found`, `pages_skipped`, `pages_failed`, `chunks_upserted`, start/end timestamps, and any `error` message."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
